    {
      "flavor_text": "ハネの　はばたきで　さばくの　すなを\nまきあげて　すがたを　かくす。あかい\nカバーが　すなから　めを　まもる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날갯짓으로 모래 폭풍을\n일으켜 모습을 감춘다. 빨간\n덮개가 모래로부터 눈을 보호한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se cache du regard des autres en soulevant le sable\ndu désert avec ses ailes. Une fine peau rouge protège\nses yeux du sable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es versteckt sich, indem es mit seinen Flügeln\nWüstensand aufwirbelt. Rote Augenlider schützen\nes vor dem Sand.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su medio es el desierto. Para esconderse, levanta\narena con las patas. Tiene los ojos protegidos con\nmallas rojas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solleva sabbia con le ali per nascondersi. Un\nrivestimento rosso protegge gli occhi dalla sabbia\nstessa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
